    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.023799896240234,
        360.27606201171875,
        408.42242431640625,
        369.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "Interpretation of the literature presented signiﬁcant challenges, as there were substantial",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.2578010559082,
        372.2730712890625,
        408.9176025390625,
        381.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "variations in the populations studied, the deﬁnition of index cases, the contacts (household,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.31180191040039,
        384.27008056640625,
        408.5576477050781,
        393.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "close, other), the methods used for screening and clinical evaluation, the diagnostic criteria",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.39280319213867,
        396.26708984375,
        408.1346435546875,
        405.2760925292969
      ],
      "text": "for TB (microbiological conﬁrmation with either microscopy or culture or clinical or radiographic",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.96981430053711,
        408.27294921875,
        408.1429138183594,
        417.2731018066406
      ],
      "text": "diagnoses), the age stratiﬁcation of children and inclusion only of ‘co-prevalent cases’ found",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.97809982299805,
        420.26995849609375,
        408.14306640625,
        429.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "at initial evaluation or ‘incident cases’ detected during various periods of follow-up. For these",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.97809982299805,
        432.2669677734375,
        398.04510498046875,
        441.2669677734375
      ],
      "text": "reasons, the evidence base for most of the recommendations was judged to be very weak.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.996097564697266,
        450.2669677734375,
        410.0962219238281,
        459.2669677734375
      ],
      "text": "In addition to the variations among the studies, there are signiﬁcant gaps in the literature.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.96909713745117,
        462.2639465332031,
        295.2022399902344,
        471.2755432128906
      ],
      "text": "No studies were found that addressed the following questions:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.04130172729492,
        480.2755432128906,
        389.1801452636719,
        489.2755432128906
      ],
      "text": "• Does contact investigation lead to a reduction in the incidence of TB in a population?",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.05929946899414,
        498.2755432128906,
        378.61419677734375,
        507.2755432128906
      ],
      "text": "• Is contact investigation cost–effective in terms of the cost per new case identiﬁed?",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.086299896240234,
        516.2755737304688,
        408.287109375,
        525.2755737304688
      ],
      "text": "• How does contact investigation ﬁt into the context of other active case-ﬁnding strategies?",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.1223030090332,
        534.2755737304688,
        377.2631530761719,
        543.2755737304688
      ],
      "text": "• What are the optimal approaches to screening and clinical evaluation of contacts?",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.04916000366211,
        552.2755737304688,
        408.259033203125,
        561.2755737304688
      ],
      "text": "As a consequence of these major gaps in the literature, programme decisions about whether",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.09415817260742,
        564.2725830078125,
        408.1784973144531,
        573.2725830078125
      ],
      "text": "to undertake contact investigation can be based only on published estimates of the prevalence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.01315689086914,
        576.2695922851562,
        410.1671142578125,
        585.2695922851562
      ],
      "text": "or yield of active TB among contacts (the number of new cases found, as reported in tables",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.040157318115234,
        588.2665405273438,
        332.2720642089844,
        597.2665405273438
      ],
      "text": "2–5) rather than on evidence about the effectiveness of the intervention.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
